# Inside Information: a spell cast this way is paid for with life "rather than pay its mana cost", an alternative cost, so no
# other alternative cost may be used with it (CR 118.9a, ruling 2026-06-29). Bot1 exiles Bot2's Fireblast; with two Mountains
# of its own, Fireblast's "sacrifice two Mountains rather than pay this spell's mana cost" is not offered from exile, and Bot1
# casts it at Bot2 for 6 life, its mana value.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Jet
Black Lotus
Inside Information
Mountain
Plains x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x8
Fireblast
Island x8

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Hand.Inside Information.Cast(Bot2; X: 1)
Bot1.Pass
! Bot1.Exile.Fireblast.Cast(Bot2; Ability: sacrifice)
Bot1.Exile.Fireblast.Cast(Bot2; Ability: 6 life)
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Turn = 3
Exile.Count = 0
Bot1.Life = 14
Bot2.Life = 16
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain#1.Tapped = false
Bot2.Graveyard = Fireblast; Island
